Part III Digital Proprietary Interface Reference

Part IV DECthreads Library Reference (OpenVMS systems Only)

Appendix A - Considerations for Systems Based on UNIX Software

Appendix B - Considerations for OpenVMS Systems

Appendix C - DECthreads Exceptions

Appendix D - DECthreads Nonstandard Types for the POSIX 1003.4a Interface

